{"id":"1ea2a066d6d8ddc5","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-complex-plane.md","title":"Complex Plane","display":"df-complex-plane — Complex Plane","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-complex-plane","aliases":["58-df-complex-plane","Complex Plane"],"display":"df-complex-plane — Complex Plane","depends_on":["[[58-df-real-number]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-complex-plane"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-complex-plane</span><span>Complex Plane</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complex-plane — Complex Plane"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83855da2e0a85ce3\" href=\"?note=83855da2e0a85ce3\" title=\"58-df-real-number\">58-df-real-number</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,r,\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(x,y,r,\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=x+iy\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(z=x+iy\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83855da2e0a85ce3\" href=\"?note=83855da2e0a85ce3\" title=\"58-df-real-number\">58-df-real-number</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\\coloneqq\\mathbb R\\times\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb C\\coloneqq\\mathbb R\\times\\mathbb R\\)</span>，并以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+iy\">\\(x+iy\\)</span> 记有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Modulus}:\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(\\operatorname{Modulus}:\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Arg}_S,\\operatorname{PolarForm}_S\\subseteq V^2,V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{Arg}_S,\\operatorname{PolarForm}_S\\subseteq V^2,V^3\\)</span>（此处定义的辐角与极坐标关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}plane} \\vdash \\mathbb C\\coloneqq\\mathbb R\\times\\mathbb R\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}plane} \\vdash \\mathbb C\\coloneqq\\mathbb R\\times\\mathbb R\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}modulus} \\vdash \\operatorname{Modulus}(x+iy)\\coloneqq\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}modulus} \\vdash \\operatorname{Modulus}(x+iy)\\coloneqq\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}argument} \\vdash \\operatorname{Arg}_S(z,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow z\\neq0\\land\\theta\\in(-\\pi,\\pi]\\land z=\\operatorname{Modulus}(z)(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}argument} \\vdash \\operatorname{Arg}_S(z,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow z\\neq0\\land\\theta\\in(-\\pi,\\pi]\\land z=\\operatorname{Modulus}(z)(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}principal\\text{-}argument} \\vdash z\\neq0\\to\\operatorname{Arg}(z)\\coloneqq\\iota\\theta\\in(-\\pi,\\pi]\\;\\operatorname{Arg}_S(z,\\theta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}principal\\text{-}argument} \\vdash z\\neq0\\to\\operatorname{Arg}(z)\\coloneqq\\iota\\theta\\in(-\\pi,\\pi]\\;\\operatorname{Arg}_S(z,\\theta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}polar\\text{-}form} \\vdash \\operatorname{PolarForm}_S(z,r,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow r=\\operatorname{Modulus}(z)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\land z=r(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}polar\\text{-}form} \\vdash \\operatorname{PolarForm}_S(z,r,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow r=\\operatorname{Modulus}(z)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\land z=r(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Complex plane: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C} \\cong \\mathbb{R}^2\">\\(\\mathbb{C} \\cong \\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span>; algebraic closure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span></li>\n<li>主辐角只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\neq0\">\\(z\\neq0\\)</span> 时定义；用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\arctan(y/x)\">\\(\\arctan(y/x)\\)</span> 会在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=0\">\\(x=0\\)</span> 失效并丢失象限信息。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^{i\\theta} = \\cos\\theta + i\\sin\\theta\">\\(e^{i\\theta} = \\cos\\theta + i\\sin\\theta\\)</span>; polar form connects algebra and geometry</li>\n<li>Riemann sphere <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C} \\cup \\{\\infty\\} \\cong \\mathbb{CP}^1\">\\(\\mathbb{C} \\cup \\{\\infty\\} \\cong \\mathbb{CP}^1\\)</span>; one-point compactification</li>\n<li>Extended complex plane is sphere; conformal = holomorphic bijection</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1\\cong\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z|=1\\}\\cong\\mathbb R/2\\pi\\mathbb Z\">\\(S^1\\cong\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z|=1\\}\\cong\\mathbb R/2\\pi\\mathbb Z\\)</span> 是派生同构，不作为复平面的定义子句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ahlfors, Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, Functions of One Complex Variable</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-real-number","status":"resolved","id":"83855da2e0a85ce3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-real-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-real-number","status":"resolved","id":"83855da2e0a85ce3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y,r,\\theta\\in\\mathbb R$，且 $z=x+iy\\in\\mathbb C$（$\\mathbb R$ 见 [[58-df-real-number]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y,r,\\theta\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"z=x+iy\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C\\coloneqq\\mathbb R\\times\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"x+iy","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Modulus}:\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Arg}_S,\\operatorname{PolarForm}_S\\subseteq V^2,V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}plane} \\vdash \\mathbb C\\coloneqq\\mathbb R\\times\\mathbb R","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}modulus} \\vdash \\operatorname{Modulus}(x+iy)\\coloneqq\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}argument} \\vdash \\operatorname{Arg}_S(z,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow z\\neq0\\land\\theta\\in(-\\pi,\\pi]\\land z=\\operatorname{Modulus}(z)(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}principal\\text{-}argument} \\vdash z\\neq0\\to\\operatorname{Arg}(z)\\coloneqq\\iota\\theta\\in(-\\pi,\\pi]\\;\\operatorname{Arg}_S(z,\\theta)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}polar\\text{-}form} \\vdash \\operatorname{PolarForm}_S(z,r,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow r=\\operatorname{Modulus}(z)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\land z=r(\\cos\\theta+i\\sin\\theta)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{C} \\cong \\mathbb{R}^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}","display":false},{"tex":"z\\neq0","display":false},{"tex":"\\arctan(y/x)","display":false},{"tex":"x=0","display":false},{"tex":"e^{i\\theta} = \\cos\\theta + i\\sin\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{C} \\cup \\{\\infty\\} \\cong \\mathbb{CP}^1","display":false},{"tex":"S^1\\cong\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z|=1\\}\\cong\\mathbb R/2\\pi\\mathbb Z","display":false}],"bytes":2083,"backlinks":[{"id":"af6c2296c347a5b6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1c3aae4ca0d902b6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fb6604241f53b69a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-complex-plane]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-335","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-complex-plane.md|58-df-complex-plane]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["83855da2e0a85ce3"]}